Resident Evil finally feels scary again.

The new Resident Evil trailer gave me a feeling I haven’t had from this franchise in a long time: actual fear. Instead of feeling like another over-the-top action movie, this looks darker, more grounded, and genuinely unsettling.

Knowing Zach Cregger is directing after Weapons gives me a lot more confidence in where this reboot is heading. And Austin Abrams continuing that collaboration makes this even more interesting.

This feels less like a sequel…
and more like a complete reset for Resident Evil.

